omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I7ZVvqQNFxcQ7kNvwHRg_w-&_nc_oc=Adq1sAScr0L80xNi51bSU7wngz-zGWGstbcXZMWNCBCQnC9xu-8kzMq2pAzlo5z7078&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDZEUHVR0Al4Ce67E2HxeLNoeK1zKHsW59XXchD2nMt_w&oe=6A69E274"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vs7vQoO4dIkQ7kNvwH-D2Q2&_nc_oc=AdpZAkn3TmtP8Bm5DU0MyXe5cMEcDJySgiSyjD5y7MS4J3j7hmNSMCdLv05FyO2YUSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAy9haPc-cPG1wq9tcJk5zjwQmylETNvR3i7GDYMTtpEA&oe=6A69E3D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wv3srWXHhDAQ7kNvwGUsS6X&_nc_oc=AdrXOciIz3rv1VGxsqk6GpG1jTAUvyDAeeqUWfvn8KKCID0Aj6EHQLB1dQEGpXwgaPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC0tWZBAeaqK0gkaKBUmcRTWWNFXcxfYkngYbJD5Z6aGQ&oe=6A69F8F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://